{"id":"73f2e90f43692fd7","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-finite-automata.md","title":"确定性有限自动机与正则语言","display":"df-finite-automata — 确定性有限自动机与正则语言","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-finite-automata","aliases":["29-df-finite-automata"],"display":"df-finite-automata — 确定性有限自动机与正则语言","depends_on":[],"source_basis":"仅据所提供的第29本书文本重建缺失接口；不声称恢复缺失外部原文或完成机器证明"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-finite-automata"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-finite-automata</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-automata — 确定性有限自动机与正则语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"仅据所提供的第29本书文本重建缺失接口；不声称恢复缺失外部原文或完成机器证明"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 为非空有限字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^*\">\\(\\Sigma^*\\)</span> 为其有限序列集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 为空序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"wa\">\\(wa\\)</span> 为向 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 追加字母 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[q]=\\{0,\\ldots,q-1\\}\">\\([q]=\\{0,\\ldots,q-1\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=(q,q_0,F,\\delta)\">\\(D=(q,q_0,F,\\delta)\\)</span> 的分量投影也记作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_D,q_D^0,F_D,\\delta_D\">\\(q_D,q_D^0,F_D,\\delta_D\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in[q_D]\">\\(s\\in[q_D]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in\\Sigma^*\">\\(w\\in\\Sigma^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\Sigma\">\\(a\\in\\Sigma\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DFA}(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\{(q,q_0,F,\\delta):q\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\land q_0\\in[q]\\land F\\subseteq[q]\\land\\delta:[q]\\times\\Sigma\\to[q]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DFA}(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\{(q,q_0,F,\\delta):q\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\land q_0\\in[q]\\land F\\subseteq[q]\\land\\delta:[q]\\times\\Sigma\\to[q]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\delta_D^*(s,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq s,\\qquad\\delta_D^*(s,wa)\\coloneqq\\delta_D(\\delta_D^*(s,w),a),\\qquad D\\in\\operatorname{DFA}(\\Sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\delta_D^*(s,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq s,\\qquad\\delta_D^*(s,wa)\\coloneqq\\delta_D(\\delta_D^*(s,w),a),\\qquad D\\in\\operatorname{DFA}(\\Sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"L(D)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*: \\delta_D^*(q_D^0,w)\\in F_D\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Regular}(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\{L(D):D\\in\\operatorname{DFA}(\\Sigma)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[L(D)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*: \\delta_D^*(q_D^0,w)\\in F_D\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Regular}(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\{L(D):D\\in\\operatorname{DFA}(\\Sigma)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只补入单子二阶逻辑定理中实际使用的有限自动机与正则语言接口；是否接受空串由初态是否属于终态集决定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"wa","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"[q]=\\{0,\\ldots,q-1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"D=(q,q_0,F,\\delta)","display":false},{"tex":"q_D,q_D^0,F_D,\\delta_D","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in[q_D]","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DFA}(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\{(q,q_0,F,\\delta):q\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\land q_0\\in[q]\\land F\\subseteq[q]\\land\\delta:[q]\\times\\Sigma\\to[q]\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\delta_D^*(s,\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq s,\\qquad\\delta_D^*(s,wa)\\coloneqq\\delta_D(\\delta_D^*(s,w),a),\\qquad D\\in\\operatorname{DFA}(\\Sigma).","display":true},{"tex":"L(D)\\coloneqq\\{w\\in\\Sigma^*: \\delta_D^*(q_D^0,w)\\in F_D\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Regular}(\\Sigma)\\coloneqq\\{L(D):D\\in\\operatorname{DFA}(\\Sigma)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1363,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-183","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-circuit-model]]、[[29-df-finite-automata]] — 电路与正则语言的实际内部数据类型及语义。"},{"id":"84915c74420134d4","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Regular}(\\Sigma)$ 取 [[29-df-finite-automata]] 的定义，是 $\\Sigma^*$ 上由确定性有限自动机识别的语言族。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-finite-automata]]"}],"outgoing":[]}